<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ event_name }} — Your Result</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px;">
  <p>Dear {{ full_name }},</p>

  <p>Thank you for applying and interviewing for {{ event_name }}. We know this took real time and effort, and we don't take that lightly.</p>

  <p>After careful review, we're not able to offer you a place this time. This was a genuinely difficult round with more strong applicants than we had places for — it isn't a reflection of your potential.</p>

  {% if next_steps %}
  <p>{{ next_steps }}</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if contact_name or contact_channel %}
  <p>Questions, or want feedback on your interview? Contact
    {% if contact_name %}{{ contact_name }}{% endif %}
    {% if contact_channel %}via {{ contact_channel }}{% endif %} — we're happy to talk it through.</p>
  {% endif %}

  <p>We hope you'll stay in touch and consider applying again in the future.</p>

  <p>{{ sender_name }}{% if reply_to %}<br>{{ reply_to }}{% endif %}</p>
</body>
</html>
